        "content": "<ul>\n<li>Anthropic Help Center — Release notes: memory across chat and Cowork, Topics in Settings &gt; Memory (Aug 25, 2026): https://docs.anthropic.com/en/release-notes/claude-apps</li>\n<li>Anthropic — Memory unified across chat and Cowork (Aug 2026): https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/25/anthropic-update-unifies-memory-feature-across-claude-cowork-and-chat/?extended-comments=1#comments</li>\n<li>ChatGPT memory controls for free users, 2026 (Settings → Personalization → Memory): https://jddaddy.com/how-chatgpt-memory-works-for-free-users-in-2026-and-how-to-control-it/</li>\n<li>OpenAI Developer Community — user reports of memory retrieval and long-chat context regressions (Oct 2026): https://community.openai.com/t/gpt-5-6-regression-memory-retrieval-fails-long-chats-lose-context-early-and-in-chat-model-switching-is-gone/1403213</li>\n<li>OpenAI Developer Community — long-conversation context retention regression reports (Oct 2026): https://community.openai.com/t/severe-regression-in-long-conversation-context-retention-and-reasoning-quality-after-a-recent-chatgpt-update/1403351</li>\n<li>Claude Pro pricing, October 2026 ($20/mo monthly, ~$17/mo annual): https://tygartmedia.com/claude-pro-vs-max-is-upgrade-worth-it-2026/</li>\n<li>ChatGPT plans compared, October 2026 (Plus $20/mo): https://dev.to/stimlau/is-chatgpt-plus-worth-20-in-2026-we-ran-the-math-3561</li>\n</ul>",
